    {
      "type": "add",
      "id": "511f4abddf458ec6",
      "item": {
        "type": "markdown",
        "id": "511f4abddf458ec6",
        "text": "An entry that ends `for [[Page]]` or `to [[Page]]` records hours **I gave** to the ledger on that page. One that ends `from [[Page]]` or `by [[Page]]` records hours **I received**. The other ledger confirms it with the opposite word and a link back to my page. A link without a direction word \u2014 `Meeting with [[David]]: 2 hours` \u2014 is an ordinary entry that happens to contain a link."
      },
      "after": "b7ce35f238cd5ec1",
