        "id": "99cdc1709ebb3b58",
        "text": "START: 1 September 2026\nEND: 7 September 2026\nNOTIFY: ntfy.sh/timebank-demo-david\nGardening for [[Alice Ledger]]: 2 hours\nRepairs from [[Alice Ledger]]: 1 hour\nA week of swaps with [[Alice Ledger]]."
