      "item": {
        "type": "markdown",
        "id": "46a90ffb474d085b",
        "text": "Two entries match when the other entry links back to this page, runs the opposite way, has the same minutes, and the same label once case, spacing and trailing punctuation are ignored. Each counter-entry confirms one entry only. When both items declare START/END the periods must overlap. On this about page Alice Ledger does not exist, so the badge above is red."
