        "id": "2565e0c18332453d",
        "text": "# Verification Badge\nGreen, orange or red beside the column header"
      },
      "after": "46a90ffb474d085b",
      "date": 1790161690359,
      "provenance": "Authored by an AI agent \u2014 Claude Code (claude-opus-5-5) executing the [[Timebank Verification Plan]]."
